-- 146: SCENE B — A MINOR MELODIC. Built from ~/tunepile hooks, made to move.
-- Structure = the HYBRID that worked in 145: a plain 4-beat frame for the body
--   (kick on the floor, snare on 2 and 4) with 13-subdivision detail and 13-token
--   phrases on top. Straight 4/4 alone lost the character (an earlier version of
--   this file had no 13 at all); all-13 alone had no backbeat. Both, layered:
--     d1/d2  4/4 foundation          d3 hats (7,13), d7 cabasa (5,13,3)
--     d6 melody and d10 counter-line: 13-TOKEN phrases, so the hook drifts
--     against the 4-beat frame rather than sitting on it. Key: A MINOR, chosen so the hooks are used verbatim
-- rather than transposed — both of these are natively in A minor / C major.
--
-- Hooks (tabs-tidal via ~/tunepile):
--   * Melody (d6) — "Nothing Compares 2 U" (1990, Sinéad O'Connor / Prince):
--       g4 c5 d5 e5 d5 c5 a4 g4 — indexed from the tunepile tab:
--         "g4 c5 d5 e5 e5 d5 c5 d5 c5 a4 g4 ..."
--       Recut into a four-phrase 8-bar arc: statement, lift, descent, resolve.
--       Voice: mars_synths_DrSample_80s_Piano (n 0) — an 80s piano sample, played
--       in its natural register (c4-c5) per the rule below.
--   * Counter-line (d10) — "Losing My Religion" (1991, R.E.M.) mandolin riff:
--       d5 e5 d5 c5 f5 f5 f5 / g4 a4 b4 c5 a4 c5 — natively A minor.
--       Voice: now mars_synths_DX100_Vibes (FM vibes) at low level and halved
--       density (`slow 4` + sometimesBy 0.5) — the sampled `pluck` was the other
--       clangy element, and vibes keep the mandolin brightness without the grit.
-- BASS: dubsynth again, but NOT at a1/f1 — a detuned saw + sine sub at 55-87 Hz
--   with a long sustain is the "fart bass" (the same lesson as the dubchord stab:
--   these voices live in the bass region by construction). Now an octave up
--   (a2/f2/c3/g2), short (sustain 0.16 / release 0.14), less saw (waveMix 0.18),
--   brighter (cutoff 420, lpf 1800) — bass-guitar register rather than sub.
-- Harmony: Am - F - C - G (bass d4 alternates two figures and walks 8 chords;
--   pad d5 holds triads [a3,c4,e4] [f3,a3,c4] [c3,e3,g3] [g3,b3,d4]).
--
-- VOICE RULE (this is what bit us three times tonight): for a SAMPLE, `note` is
--   PLAYBACK SPEED, not pitch-from-a-sampler. A sampled voice must stay near its
--   natural register. Failures: gs3 on the marimba dragged it to molasses;
--   `|+ note 12` turned it into a squeak (2x speed); the OB_Strings pad voiced
--   down at b3/a3 (sample root ~C4) played at 0.6-0.7x and its tape wobble
--   stretched into a bassy "farting" chord. Hence: keep sample melodies in
--   c4-c5, use SYNTH voices (hoRhodes/orkRhodes) when real pitch is needed.
-- TEMPO/SPACE: 120 BPM (cps 0.5, same as the rest of the session) but much
--   sparser — melody and pad both at
--   `slow 4` (a phrase every ~10 s), bass on half-notes only, tambourine (d7) out,
--   hats at gain 0.26, and the counter-line halved in density. Space is mostly
--   achieved by REMOVING HITS, not by reverb.
-- VARIATION (the "go wild" pass): every layer has movement rather than repeating —
--   d1 kick `sometimesBy 0.15 (fast 2)` (occasional double), d2 snare an
--   `every 8 (fast 2)` fill, d3 hats alternate four different 13-densities,
--   d4 bass alternates two figures and walks an 8-chord progression, d5 pad
--   extended to 8 chords (Am F C G Am F Dm E), d6 hook lifts an octave every 4th
--   pass (`every 4 (|+ note 12)` — safe on a SYNTH, lethal on a sample), d7 cabasa
--   alternates, d8 clap gets a delay throw, d11 ghatam perc layer,
--   d12 soaring DX100_Sine top line (fast-2 every 4th).
-- GRUNGE vs SWEET: the "sweet but a bit grungy" character comes from the MASTER
--   TAPE SATURATION rather than from dirtying the voices: mSat 0.5, mCut 9500,
--   mHpf 48, mGain 0.95 (~masterSet), plus shape 0.6 on the kick and 0.2 on the
--   snare. Clean sources, dirty sum.
-- Mix: dry kit; space only on pad (verbSend 0.28) and the melody voices (0.25/0.2).
--   Master aux returns are 0 (see sc/routing.scd) and the kit carries no sends.
setcps 0.5

d1 $ sometimesBy 0.15 (fast 2) $ s "808bd*4" # gain 0.9 # shape 0.6 # hpf 46 # release 0.09 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d2 $ every 8 (fast 2) $ s "~ drumtraks:9 ~ drumtraks:9" # gain 0.75 # hpf 420 # shape 0.2 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d3 $ s "<drumtraks:4(7,13) drumtraks:4(11,13) drumtraks:4(5,13) drumtraks:4(9,13)>" # gain "0.4 0.24 0.3 0.26 0.34 0.24 0.3 0.26 0.32 0.24 0.3 0.26 0.3" # hpf 2000 # lpf 9000 # pan 0.6 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d4 $ note "<[a2 ~ ~ ~ e3 ~ ~ ~] [f2 ~ ~ ~ c3 ~ ~ ~] [c3 ~ ~ ~ g3 ~ ~ ~] [g2 ~ ~ ~ d3 ~ ~ ~] [a2 ~ e3 ~ a2 ~ e3 ~] [f2 ~ c3 ~ f2 ~ c3 ~] [d3 ~ a3 ~ d3 ~ a3 ~] [e3 ~ b3 ~ e3 ~ b3 ~]>" # s "dubsynth" # waveMix 0.18 # cutoff 420 # fenv 2.2 # drive 0.35 # sustain 0.16 # release 0.14 # lpf 1800 # gain 0.6 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d5 $ slow 4 $ n "<[a3,c4,e4] [f3,a3,c4] [c3,e3,g3] [g3,b3,d4] [a3,c4,e4] [f3,a3,c4] [d3,f3,a3] [e3,gs3,b3]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain 0.6 # cutoff 2200 # attack 0.05 # release 2.0 # verbSend 0.28 # room 0.5 # size 0.6 # ddSend 0

d6 $ every 4 (|+ note 12) $ slow 4 $ note "<[g4 ~ c5 d5 ~ e5 d5 c5 d5 ~ c5 a4 g4] [g4 ~ c5 d5 ~ e5 d5 c5 d5 ~ e5 d5 c5] [a4 ~ c5 d5 e5 d5 c5 ~ a4 g4 ~ ~ ~] [g4 c5 d5 e5 d5 c5 a4 g4 ~ ~ ~ ~ ~]>" # s "hoRhodes" # gain 0.72 # cutoff 4200 # release 1.4 # verbSend 0.25 # room 0.5 # size 0.55 # ddSend 0

d7 $ s "<drumtraks:0(5,13,3) drumtraks:0(3,13,7) drumtraks:0(7,13)>" # gain 0.26 # hpf 2400 # lpf 10000 # pan 0.45 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d8 $ s "~ ~ ~ drumtraks:1" # gain 0.5 # hpf 750 # lpf 7200 # release 0.09 # ddSend 0.25 # lock 1 # delaytime (3/16) # delayfeedback 0.3 # verbSend 0

d9 $ silence

d10 $ slow 4 $ sometimesBy 0.5 id $ note "<[d5 ~ ~ ~ c5 ~ ~ ~ f5 ~ ~ ~ ~] [g4 ~ ~ ~ a4 ~ ~ ~ c5 ~ ~ ~ ~]>" # s "mars_synths_DX100_Vibes" # n 0 # gain 0.5 # hpf 300 # lpf 5000 # verbSend 0.2 # ddSend 0.15 # lock 1 # delaytime (3/16) # delayfeedback 0.2

d11 $ s "p93perc(3,13)" # gain 0.32 # hpf 500 # lpf 6500 # pan 0.42 # release 0.2 # verbSend 0 # ddSend 0

d12 $ every 4 (fast 2) $ slow 4 $ note "<[e5 ~ ~ g5 a5 ~ g5 ~ e5 ~ d5 ~ ~] [c5 ~ ~ e5 g5 ~ e5 ~ c5 ~ b4 ~ ~]>" # s "mars_synths_DX100_Sine" # n 0 # gain 0.42 # hpf 400 # lpf 6000 # verbSend 0.3 # room 0.5 # size 0.6 # ddSend 0.25 # lock 1 # delaytime (3/16) # delayfeedback 0.3

d13 $ silence

d14 $ silence

d15 $ silence

d16 $ silence
